  "releaseNotes": "Added events to TemplatedTaskLoader for each control template state (LoadingControlTemplateLoaded, ResultControlTemplateLoaded, ErrorControlTemplateLoaded, EmptyControlTemplateLoaded). These events are raised when the corresponding control template is loaded, allowing you to react to state changes.",
